WEBVTT

00:38:57.076 --> 00:39:01.798
but we have a tool
for teachers to use where they can...

00:39:01.822 --> 00:39:03.735
We call it a Quiet Engagement Rubric,

00:39:03.759 --> 00:39:06.274
and it's different ways of thinking about

00:39:06.298 --> 00:39:08.744
how a child can kind of
show up in a classroom

00:39:08.768 --> 00:39:11.996
without the classic raising
your hand over and over.

00:39:12.020 --> 00:39:15.136
CA: So there's been all these changes
already happening, I think,

00:39:15.160 --> 00:39:17.775
in work and school and elsewhere
and in the culture.

00:39:17.799 --> 00:39:23.266
I just saw this article in "The Guardian"
that was kind of interesting.

00:39:23.290 --> 00:39:27.622
It was called, "Why the 'introverts v
extroverts' battle helps neither side."

00:39:27.646 --> 00:39:30.255
This is, in a way, a bit of pushback.